{"product_id":"delta-smartwatch","title":"Delta Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eStyle up the smarter side of life with the Delta Smartwatch, featuring the largest 2.04” HD Curved Display in Smartwatches. Powered by a 3D Curved Smart Display and a Metallic Frame with a fully functional Rotating Crown, Delta includes an Active Health Suite and a 5 Day Battery Life to ensure you’re connected at every pulse.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Delta:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2.04” HD Curved Display\u003cbr\u003e3D Smart Display\u003cbr\u003eMetallic Frame\u003cbr\u003eActive Health Suite\u003cbr\u003e5 Day Battery Life\u003cbr\u003eWorkout Modes\u003cbr\u003eHeart Rate Monitor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Delta:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: Full-color touch screen.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivity Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization\u003c\/strong\u003e: Multiple customizable watch faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":48697196675350,"sku":"20608","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Masala Red","offer_id":48697196740886,"sku":"20612","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gray Gun Metal","offer_id":48697196708118,"sku":"20613","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/